==Icelandic==

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|lagði|lagt}}

# {{context|transitive|governs the accusative}} to [[lay]], to [[put]]{{jump|is|lay|d|s}}
#: '''''Leggðu''' bókina niður.''
#:: '''Put''' the book down.
# {{context|transitive|governs the accusative}} to [[build]]{{jump|is|build|s}}
#: ''Að '''leggja''' hellur.''
#:: To '''pave'''.
#: ''Að '''leggja''' veg.''
#:: To '''build''' a road.
# {{context|transitive|governs the accusative}} to [[jab]], to [[thrust]]{{jump|is|thrust|d|s}}
# {{context|ambitransitive|lang=is|governs the dative}} to [[park]], to [[park]] a [[vehicle]]{{jump|is|park|s}}
#: ''Ég kann ekki að '''leggja'''.''
#:: I don't know how to '''park'''.
#: ''Hvernig gekk að '''leggja''' bílnum?''
#:: How did '''parking''' the car go?
#: ''Að '''leggja''' bíl við hliðina á öðrum sem er í stæði.''
#:: To [[double-park|double-'''park''']].
# {{context|impersonal|governs the dative|lang=is}} 
#: ''Tjörnina '''lagði'''.''
#:: The lake '''froze over'''.
#: ''Reykinn '''lagði''' um húsið.''
#:: The smoke '''filled''' the house.

